                        "entry_id": "88f7a51c-3274-3de1-a0f9-9377441a5bc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instrument for detecting and for measuring odors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2eca5e2-8f47-436d-a24c-ae036684a2a4",
                                "sense_id": "3179e7da-2ec5-3364-b669-bc7bdce298df",
                                "text": "Odorless air enters osmoscope through side tube where it is mixed with odorous test air which enters from end tube."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d97e444b-108d-41d2-a29f-a935a74aaa7f",
                                "sense_id": "3179e7da-2ec5-3364-b669-bc7bdce298df",
                                "text": "Test for odor, using a normal inhalation. If an osmoscope is used, insert the tube of the osmoscope to a point just above the surface of the water and test for odor as above."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac121204-1ea1-482d-a9e5-f61c46c7ff86",
                                "sense_id": "3179e7da-2ec5-3364-b669-bc7bdce298df",
                                "text": "The osmoscope may be used by increasing the dilution of air until the odor vanishes, or decreasing the dilution until the odor is first detectable."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "479acd2a-1290-3b09-a9c4-fa8bd686160d",
                        "entry_id": "88f7a51c-3274-3de1-a0f9-9377441a5bc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instrument for measuring osmosis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5631613-3575-4b57-84a8-ae96b3aa2489",
                                "sense_id": "479acd2a-1290-3b09-a9c4-fa8bd686160d",
                                "text": "The osmoscopes developed in the authors' laboratory are comparable in their basic concept with the grease-spot photometer employed by Bunsen to measure the intensity of a light source."
                            }
                        ]
